    <div class="Keyword"><a name="_dfa8ea11-0a57-18d5-b3da-9e22626e9faa" id="_dfa8ea11-0a57-18d5-b3da-9e22626e9faa"></a><p class="h1Preface">Keywords</p><p class="MsoNormal">Counterfeiting, ICT devices.</p></div></div>
