      <p class="zzSTDTitle1">Technical Report
  ITU-T QTR-CICT</p>
      <p class="zzSTDTitle2">Survey report on counterfeit ICT devices in Africa region</p>
      <div>
        <a name="_5155ee56-5cff-7508-0ec7-172f129f6a79" id="_5155ee56-5cff-7508-0ec7-172f129f6a79"></a>
