        </h1>
        <p class="annex_obligation">(This appendix does not form an integral part of this Technical Report.)</p>
        <p style="display:none;" class="variant-title-toc">Appendix I<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Questionnaire: ITU Survey on Counterfeit ICT Devices in Africa Region</p>
        <p style="text-align:left;" align="left" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_925991d0-10c5-3f69-e07c-fcdd7b441377" id="_925991d0-10c5-3f69-e07c-fcdd7b441377"></a><i>PART 1: TO BE COMPLETED BY ICT MINISTRIES/REGULATORY AUTHORITIES</i><br/> <i>PART 2: TO BE COMPLETED BY OPERATORS &amp; DEALERS IN ICT DEVICES</i><br/> <i>PART 3: TO BE COMPLETED BY CONSUMER GROUPS</i></p>
        <p style="text-align:left;" align="left" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_20074d38-d7c1-8e55-a60e-aa603235d836" id="_20074d38-d7c1-8e55-a60e-aa603235d836"></a><i>PLEASE SUBMIT YOUR REPLY BY 15 MARCH 2016 TO:</i><br/> <i>Isaac BOATENG, vice-chairman ITU-T SG11 ( <a href="mailto:isaac.boateng@nca.org.gh" class="url">isaac.boateng@nca.org.gh</a>; <a href="mailto:tsbsg11@itu.int" class="url">tsbsg11@itu.int</a>)</i></p>
        <div><a name="_4f6c3560-4cf2-109a-61d9-cf11ddcdabf8" id="_4f6c3560-4cf2-109a-61d9-cf11ddcdabf8"></a><h2>I.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>PART 1: [TO BE COMPLETED BY ICT MINISTRIES/REGULATORY AUTHORITIES]</h2>

