<div class="ul_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo9;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_6f6290f9-5bb3-4c08-7cb5-ada7a20ccad0" id="_6f6290f9-5bb3-4c08-7cb5-ada7a20ccad0"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>Yes.
