<div class="ListContLevel1"><div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo13;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="q6a" id="q6a"></a>Do you have any public awareness programme on counterfeit ICT devices in your country?
</p>
