<div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo100;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="q10a" id="q10a"></a>Is there any national body in your country to fight against the proliferation of the counterfeit ICT devices?
</p>
