<div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo101;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="q10b" id="q10b"></a>If <b><i>Yes</i></b>, how effective is this national body? (<i>Please indicate a number on a scale of 1 to 5, with 5 being highly effective and 1 being highly ineffective to indicate your rating on <a href="#q10a">List 13 a)</a> above.</i>)
</p>
</div>

