<div class="ListContLevel1"><div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo21;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="q11" id="q11"></a>Are there national policies and laws or statutory enactments on the manufacturing, importation, distribution and usage of ICT devices in your country?
</p>
