</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo23;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_a1b38db9-da2c-3e5f-be93-320b866689fc" id="_a1b38db9-da2c-3e5f-be93-320b866689fc"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>2
