</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo23;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_17247245-04a8-93aa-96aa-44af05805879" id="_17247245-04a8-93aa-96aa-44af05805879"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>5
<div class="ListContLevel1"><div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo23;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="q13a" id="q13a"></a>Is there any legal framework and regulation which protects the intellectual property rights of manufacturers and authorised dealers of ICT devices in your country?
</p>
