</p>
</div>

<div class="ul_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo24;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_b8a297e1-fdf8-fbe7-76a6-eb816f5b3edc" id="_b8a297e1-fdf8-fbe7-76a6-eb816f5b3edc"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>Yes.
