</p>
</div>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_199ee608-bea6-e34f-7bcf-ebd2fb158432" id="_199ee608-bea6-e34f-7bcf-ebd2fb158432"></a>If <b><i>Yes</i></b>, which one(s)?</p>

<div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo103;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="q13b" id="q13b"></a>If <b><i>Yes</i></b>, what measures have been put in place to enforce the framework and regulation?<br/> <i>Please specify below</i>:
<div class="ListContLevel1"><div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo103;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_6f3c8839-3aba-9567-cc3e-99007e0c4ad1" id="_6f3c8839-3aba-9567-cc3e-99007e0c4ad1"></a>__________<br/>
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo103;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_7327a560-9d1b-c4fc-efcf-ff701482dc1c" id="_7327a560-9d1b-c4fc-efcf-ff701482dc1c"></a>__________<br/>
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo103;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_a08bdc39-6358-5b25-f9df-7f754ad19e8e" id="_a08bdc39-6358-5b25-f9df-7f754ad19e8e"></a>__________
</p>
</div></div>
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo103;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="q14a" id="q14a"></a>Is the authenticity of ICT devices verified in your country?
