</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo42;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_8b97919c-d164-49c9-47b0-86b1c817c562" id="_8b97919c-d164-49c9-47b0-86b1c817c562"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>Others (<i>please specify below</i>): __________
<div class="ListContLevel1"><div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo42;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_87928312-d27b-7d49-e352-9e3def94a9a7" id="_87928312-d27b-7d49-e352-9e3def94a9a7"></a>Do you believe that there is patronage of counterfeit ICT devices in your country? If so, in your view, what is the motive for the patronage? (<i>Please tick (&#x2713;) all that applies</i>)
</p>
</div></div>
</p>
</div>

<div class="ul_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo43;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_004d8712-e2d6-5960-f174-23408e986e87" id="_004d8712-e2d6-5960-f174-23408e986e87"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>There is no patronage
</p>
