<div class="ListContLevel1"><div class="ol_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l2 level2 lfo43;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_1e8330fe-cd8b-f200-83df-adb97fbf33db" id="_1e8330fe-cd8b-f200-83df-adb97fbf33db"></a>What have been the negative effects of counterfeit ICT devices in your country? (<i>Please tick (&#x2713;) all that applies in the table below</i>).
</p>
</div></div>
</p>
</div>

<div class="ul_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo44;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_91807f14-e316-fcf3-bf4a-e2efddc36247" id="_91807f14-e316-fcf3-bf4a-e2efddc36247"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>Infringement on property and copy rights or trademarks.
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo44;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_ad350c12-f36c-788e-36a9-3df1de6cc4f0" id="_ad350c12-f36c-788e-36a9-3df1de6cc4f0"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>Threat to public health and safety.
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo44;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_2118d000-08f3-eef7-2944-3be7746231d0" id="_2118d000-08f3-eef7-2944-3be7746231d0"></a><span>&#x2610; </span>Threat to digital financial services like mobile banking.
</p>
