        <p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b687689a-73c1-4181-47d1-6d3b7142b70b" id="_b687689a-73c1-4181-47d1-6d3b7142b70b"></a>The raw data which forms the responses from the fourteen (14) ITU Member States is contained in <a href="https://www.itu.int/md/T13-SG11-160627-TD-GEN-1199/en">TD 1199 (GEN/11)</a>.</p>
      </div>
